<title>JAPAN: THK jumps on bright business outlook.</title>
<headline>THK jumps on bright business outlook.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in THK Co Ltd jumped on Thursday afternoon, lifted by its bright earnings forecast and strong demand for its products, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0518 GMT, the shares of the manufacturer of linear motion systems stood at 1,920 yen in over-the-counter trade after closing at 1,810 on Wednesday.</p>
